# Paths that require review from a human before merge.
#
# This file is the enforcement half of the "do not loop on this" list. The other half is
# scripts/check_invariants.py. Both are listed here, deliberately: an agent that can edit
# its own gate or its own workflow disables every guardrail in a single PR, which is the
# same reward-hacking failure as editing the test suite, one level up.
#
# Requires branch protection with "Require review from Code Owners" enabled, otherwise
# this file is decorative.

# --- the verifier: the scorer the loop must not be able to edit ---
/tests/test_anchors.py          @vaibhavhariram
/tests/fixtures/mutations.py    @vaibhavhariram

# --- semantics: enum names and the domain model are customer-facing ---
/src/corpora/models.py          @vaibhavhariram

# --- the pre-registration: an amendment must not land silently ---
/docs/study-protocol.md         @vaibhavhariram

# --- the rules themselves ---
/CLAUDE.md                      @vaibhavhariram
/docs/architecture.md           @vaibhavhariram
/docs/decisions/                @vaibhavhariram

# --- the loop's own machinery ---
/scripts/                       @vaibhavhariram
/.github/                       @vaibhavhariram
/Makefile                       @vaibhavhariram
